According to the 2025 SRO, the inspection committee to approve applications for the duty exemption now includes the following members:

(a) Additional Secretary (Customs Policy), National Board of Revenue, Dhaka;
(b) Relevant VAT Departmental Officer; 
(c) A representative from the Ministry of Industries; and
(d) An appropriate representative from a public university in Bangladesh.

This expanded committee composition brings in more diverse expertise compared to the earlier SROs.
